<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz industry output rises 22.9 pct in Jan-May.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz industry output rises 22.9 pct in Jan-May.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's industrial production rose 22.9 percent in Jan-May 1997, compared to 13.0 percent in the same period last year, the National Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZSTAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT   Jan-May 97   Jan-May 96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	    +22.9	  +13.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
